// ---- src/diagrams/geopolitics/_africa.js ----
// Shared by the maps of Africa (africa-un-votes, russia-africa): the 54 member states of the UN in Africa, an Equal
// Earth frame on 20° E cut to Africa, the countries as SVG paths (dist/countries.js, Natural Earth), the small island
// states as dots so that they can be seen, Western Sahara apart (disputed, not a member).
//
//   GeoRes.africa.STATES               ISO3 codes of the 54 states
//   GeoRes.africa.map(th, box, fill, opts)   SVG of the map: fill(iso) -> colour or null (land colour);
//                                      opts.stroke(iso) -> [colour, width] or null, opts.attr(iso) -> extra attributes
//   GeoRes.africa.name(L, iso)         the name of a state in English or French
//   GeoRes.africa.point(box, lon, lat) [x, y] of a place in the same frame
