// Sim "map-classes": the same data, different maps. The share of yes to the CO2 law (13 June 2021) in each of the 2 105
// communes, classified in four ways: equal intervals (0–20, 20–40 … %), quantiles (five classes of the same number of
// communes), classes around 50 % (red for no, blue for yes) and yes or no (two classes). For each: its legend (with the
// number of communes in each class), the histogram of the communes' shares with the class breaks, and what the map
// suggests. Hover or tap a commune: its name, its share of yes and its place in the histogram; hover a class of the
// legend: its communes. Follows the page's light/dark theme.
//   <div class="geores" data-sim="map-classes"></div>
//   data-method: equal (default), quantiles, diverging, binary
//   data-title="false": no title (on a slide, which has its own)
