      sgxWhy2: "The numbers are metres on the Swiss projection: a cylinder tilted to touch the Earth along a circle through Bern, so that Switzerland is hardly distorted.",
      sgxSource: "Map: © swisstopo", sgxLoading: "Loading the map…",
