// The original stays at its place, faded. Readout: the area of the country and how much bigger its picture is on this
// map than at the equator (the area of its picture, over that of its picture centred on the equator). Hover or tap a
// country: its name. Another country can be added from the list. Follows the page's light/dark theme.
//   <div class="geores" data-sim="true-size" data-countries="GRL,COD,BRA,AUS"></div>
//   data-countries  ADM0_A3 codes of Natural Earth (AFR: Africa as a whole), comma-separated
