// ---- src/sims/geology/seafloor-spreading.js ----
// Sim "seafloor-spreading": the proof of plate tectonics. At a mid-ocean ridge, new ocean floor forms and
// moves away on both sides; its rock records the direction of the Earth's magnetic field as it cools. The
