// ---- src/sims/geopolitics/borders-pov.js ----
// Sim "borders-pov": the world seen from different countries. The same disputed areas belong to different
// countries depending on who draws the map: choose a point of view (the government of one of 31 countries,
// as encoded by Natural Earth, or an international view) and a region (Himalaya, Black Sea, Western Sahara,
// East Asia, Eastern Mediterranean, Horn of Africa, Falklands). Every country and area is filled with the
// colour of its owner in that view, the same colour in every view; disputed areas have a dashed outline; the
// country whose view it is gets a gold outline (not the accent colour: a blue would look like a coast). Move over the map: the name, who administers
// and who claims, and the owner in this view.
