        "Territorial seas: the sea that belongs to the coastal state, like its land. 12 nautical miles (22 km) for most states, but only 6 nm for Greece and Turkey in the Aegean. At 12, about 70 % of the Aegean would be Greek: in 1995, Turkey's parliament declared that this would be a cause for war.",
